# Galleon (41540004), Nova and Thor. DRAFT by lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26,
# not played. One file: no profile screen was seen on the way in; a save
# prompt, if New Game shows one, is accepted with A.
#
# Evidence: pass 1 (0-0-y-1790433159-titleplay-p1-galleon, Thor), frames in
# its route-frames/ (t = seconds after the route started):
#   115331 t20 SCi logo
#   115354 t40 the title, "Please press the START button to begin"
#   115417 t63 "Loading..." at 0 fps: left alone, the title times out into
#          an attract demo, and that load held ~2.5 min (115615 black,
#          115627-115712 the demo, marked "Demo")
#   115718 the title background again after START+A; 115748 an options
#          submenu (Audio / Controller / Display / Done) that pass 1's A
#          walked into; 115814 "Loading..." with a gameplay tip ("Rhama
#          cannot fall off an edge...") -- a game was starting
#   115841 on the ship's deck at the wheel; 115909 a close-up of Rhama with
#          a map (a cutscene); 115936 Loading; 120004 the ship at a jetty.
#
# The one timing that matters: START must reach the title between ~40 and
# ~60 s, before it times out into the 2.5 min demo load. The route presses
# START at 38, 44 and 50 s; a START on the main menu would pick its first
# item, which is the one this route wants anyway [guess: New Game first].
wait 38
shot boot38
press START                 # [seen 115354] title at t40
wait 6
shot title44
press START                 # [inferred] second chance at the title, or picks the first menu item
wait 6
shot menu50
mark booted
press A                     # [guess] New Game (first item)
wait 8
shot after-new-game         # OPEN: a difficulty or save prompt; A takes its default
press A
wait 30
shot loading                # [seen 115814] the loading screen with tips; OPEN: "Press A" to leave it
press A
wait 20
shot deck                   # [seen 115841] the deck at the wheel
repeat 10 {
    press A                 # [inferred] cutscenes and dialogue advance on A (pass 1 got through them)
    wait 6
    shot story-a
}
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame with Rhama walking under the stick
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 2
    axis LY mid
    axis LX max
    wait 1
    axis LX mid
    press A
    wait 1
    axis LY min
    wait 2
    axis LY mid
    axis LX min
    wait 1
    axis LX mid
    press A
    wait 1
}
